questions.text:
You've got a letter from your English pen-friend. In his /her letter he/she describes his/her impressions of visiting the festival of modern pop-music. Write a letter to your pen-friend and say
 what kind of music you like best;
 how your favourite kind of music makes you feel;
 what your parents think about your musical preferences.
 Write a letter of at least 100 words. Do not use any personal information (e. g. fames, dates, addresses. etc.). Start your letter in an appropriate way.
